      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi there apple!\n\n\"Being able to blit to the main camera is very useful\" is certainly interesting. \n\nI'd like to hear more about what your, (and others)use-cases for this is so that we can better try to come up with a solution here that doesn't involve this exact process.\n\nWe'd like to keep things consistent between platforms, and because of the way Quest renders things, we would likely need to have another solution.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
