      "value": "@{617d8291e4c1214cfd4234eb|full_name}\n\nWell aware of how big the shader community is as I actively participate there!\n\nI've wanted custom post processing for a long time, in fact. Sadly there's not a lot of options that don't just straight up destroy quest rendering, Tile based GPUs expect to render a pixel once, and anything more tends to break that expectation, it's one of the reason post processing doesn't exist on mobile as far as I'm aware.\n\nThat said, I'd like to come up with a solution that would work for both platforms, genuinely.\n\nIf you know of any ways to implement custom post processing and full screen effects that don't break the bank on mobile, I'm all ears.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
